opening-era history of the warehouse district describes Jim Brewer’s property investments during the 1980s within Bricktown’s broader redevelopment story.", "source_note": "", "evidence": "", "metadata": {"id": "article-6", "date": "1999-07-01", "title": "Bricktown: a hub of Oklahoma City history", "publisher": "The Journal Record", "categories": ["business"], "type": "Historical feature", "url": "https://journalrecord.com/1999/07/01/bricktown-a-hub39-of-oklahoma-city-history/", "summary": "A canal-opening-era history of the warehouse district describes Jim Brewer’s property investments during the 1980s within Bricktown’s broader redevelopment story.", "context": "", "status": "published"}, "status": "published"}, {"id": "article-7", "title": "Heartland Flyer anniversary preparations", "publisher": "The Journal Record", "author": "", "date_label": "2000-06-06", "date_sort": "2000-06-06", "source_url": "https://journalrecord.com/2000/06/06/plans-for-celebrating-heartland-flyer-anniversary-in-full-gear-in-transit/", "categories": ["business", "festivals"], "article_type": "News report", "summary": "A preview of the train’s first-anniversary celebrations mentions Jim Brewer hosting a special luncheon. The article documents plans rather than confirming every event occurred.", "source_note": "", "evidence": "", "metadata": {"id": "article-7", "date": "2000-06-06", "title": "Heartland Flyer anniversary preparations", "publisher": "The Journal Record", "categories": ["business", "festivals"], "type": "News report", "url": "https://journalrecord.com/2000/06/06/plans-for-celebrating-heartland-flyer-anniversary-in-full-gear-in-transit/", "summary": "A preview of the train’s first-anniversary celebrations mentions Jim Brewer hosting a special luncheon. The article documents plans rather than confirming every event occurred.", "context": "", "status": "published"}, "status": "published"}, {"id": "article-8", "title": "Pioneering Bricktown", "publisher": "The Journal Record", "a